# Walkthrough - Window Controls Fix, Battery Percentage Fix & Chrome Integration

We have completed the implementation and verification for Part A (Window Controls Fix), Part B (Battery Percentage Fix), and Part C (Chrome & Web Search Integration) across Peacock OS.

