## Changes Implemented

### Part A: Window Controls Fix (Minimize & Close)
- **Preload Bridge**: Updated [`preload.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/preload.js) to expose `windowAPI`:
  - `windowAPI.minimize()` -> `ipcRenderer.send('window:minimize')`
  - `windowAPI.close()` -> `ipcRenderer.send('window:close')`
- **Main Process Handlers**: Added dynamic window resolution in [`main.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js):
  - Used `BrowserWindow.fromWebContents(event.sender)` to scope `window:minimize` and `window:close` accurately to the calling window instead of hardcoding global references.
- **Shared Window Controls Helper**: Created [`window-controls.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/window-controls.js) to auto-attach event listeners on `#btn-minimize` and `#btn-close` (or `#win-close-btn`).
