### Part B: Fix Incorrect Battery Percentage
- **Desktop System Detection & Integer Rounding**: Updated `show_battery()` in [`lexer.py`](file:///d:/door-os/python-services/lexer.py):
  - Handles `psutil.sensors_battery() == None` by returning `is_desktop: True` and AC power status.
  - Rounds floating-point battery percentages (`round(battery.percent)`).
- **Periodic 30s Broadcast**: Added `fetchAndBroadcastBattery()` interval loop in [`main.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js) to push battery updates every 30 seconds to all active `BrowserWindow` instances (`battery_update` event).
- **Single Source Sync**: Updated Taskbar ([`renderer.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/renderer.js)), Settings ([`settings.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/settings.js)), and Control Panel ([`control-panel.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/control-panel.js)) to listen to the unified broadcast and display in-sync battery state.

