### Part C: Install / Integrate Chrome & Web Search
- **Chrome Detection**: Implemented `findChromePath()` in [`main.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js) checking standard Windows (`C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe`), macOS, and Linux installation paths.
- **Web Search API**: Added `browser:checkChrome`, `browser:openExternal`, and `browser:searchWeb` IPC handlers in [`main.js`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/main.js).
- **Taskbar Search Button & Modal**:
  - Added 🔍 Search button to taskbar in [`index.html`](file:///d:/door-os/desktop-shell/index.html).
  - Added web search popup modal with query input and Chrome installation status alert prompt.
  - If Chrome is not installed, displays prompt with link to Google Chrome download (`https://www.google.com/chrome/`) while gracefully searching via system default browser.

